pareto_genaL␀␀A Pareto continuous random variable.

    %(before_notes)s

    Notes
    -----
    The probability density function for `pareto` is:

    .. math::

        f(x, b) = \frac{b}{x^{b+1}}

    for :math:`x \ge 1`, :math:`b > 0`.

    `pareto` takes ``b`` as a shape parameter for :math:`b`.

