„␀«␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Zy)Úuniform_gena␀␀A uniform continuous random variable.

    In the standard form, the distribution is uniform on ``[0, 1]``. Using
    the parameters ``loc`` and ``scale``, one obtains the uniform distribution
    on ``[loc, loc + scale]``.

